 "text": "Hello there! How's life treating you? Lots of open space to look at. Stickers need be on side far from the entrance, so they can see it coming. That's good spot. Tent poles will block it, each corner needs to be at least twenty feet from the tree. Cut it off and tie it with a really long guy if you leave it in. Dead trees break and then you' digging tent pegs in the dark. That's the main challenge. Tent poles block the trees, and you can't seen into the pit from here. Wind makes a big difference. Stickers need to be on the wall side, at roof level or higher, and guy ropes and pegs at every pole.",
